{
    "title": "Fisher-Price\u00ae Smart Connect\u2122",
    "description": "The Fisher-Price\u00ae Smart Connect\u2122 app lets you customize and control all the soothing features of any Smart Connect\u2122 nursery gear, including  bassinets and soothers, right from your smart device\u2014without disturbing your baby! Find the soothing combination that works best for your baby and easily adjust as their preferences change (and change again).  \r\n\r\n \r\nWith the Smart Connect\u2122 app, you can: \r\n\r\n\u2022 Choose from a variety of gentle music selections, soothing nature sounds, or white noise, as well as adjust the volume \r\n\u2022 Set timers based on your baby\u2019s needs \r\n\u2022 Add engaging light features (where applicable) \r\n\u2022 Save your baby\u2019s favorite settings with presets \r\n\u2022 Control multiple Smart Connect\u2122 items from the same device \r\n\u2022 Take your baby\u2019s fave tunes wherever you go  \r\n\r\n\r\nQuick to setup and convenient to use, the Smart Connect\u2122 app from Fisher-Price helps make new-parent life that much easier. Download today and get connected!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Fisher-Price\u00ae Smart Connect\u2122 app lets you customize and control all the soothing features of any Smart Connect\u2122 nursery gear, including  bassinets and soothers, right from your smart device\u2014without disturbing your baby! Find the soothing combination that works best for your baby and easily adjust as their preferences change (and change again).  <br><br> <br>With the Smart Connect\u2122 app, you can: <br><br>\u2022 Choose from a variety of gentle music selections, soothing nature sounds, or white noise, as well as adjust the volume <br>\u2022 Set timers based on your baby\u2019s needs <br>\u2022 Add engaging light features (where applicable) <br>\u2022 Save your baby\u2019s favorite settings with presets <br>\u2022 Control multiple Smart Connect\u2122 items from the same device <br>\u2022 Take your baby\u2019s fave tunes wherever you go  <br><br><br>Quick to setup and convenient to use, the Smart Connect\u2122 app from Fisher-Price helps make new-parent life that much easier. Download today and get connected!",
